2026-11-04T04:14:08.1855575Z     def test_review_multiple_files_over_budget_splits_into_batches(tmp_path):
2026-11-04T04:14:08.1855736Z         """When several files' combined content doesn't fit one call, must degrade
2026-11-04T04:14:08.1855894Z         to multiple separate review calls (each within budget) rather than either
2026-11-04T04:14:08.1856050Z         silently truncating the combined prompt or crashing - every file must
2026-11-04T04:14:08.1856204Z         actually reach the model in some call, clearly labeled which batch."""
