2026-11-04T04:14:08.1888965Z         run was already forcing every Maven subprocess onto JDK 17 via
2026-11-04T04:14:08.1889108Z         JAVA_HOME. Confirms the wiring fix: with the override active and its
2026-11-04T04:14:08.1889259Z         target (17) reported as toolchain['java_version'], the flag - required
2026-11-04T04:14:08.1889395Z         on 17, forbidden only on 24+ - must survive, even though mvn's own
2026-11-04T04:14:08.1889480Z         untouched default is 26."""
